      <h1>one-prerelease</h1>
      <p>A row with a single prerelease published, which is the sentence written in the singular</p>
      <p>A row with a single prerelease published, with a paragraph behind it, so that the sentence about a prerelease and the prose from the file are shown to sit on one page without either displacing the other.</p>
      <p>What it needs before it is any use is the prerelease that is already published for it, which is what the state sentence beside this one says.</p>
      <p>What it does with data about a person is nothing.</p>
      <p>The plugin is being built. Nothing finished is published for it, so there is nothing to install and installing what is in the repository would add nothing a user can see. One prerelease is published, which is something to test rather than something to run.</p>
      <p>The plugin is built in the repository Fixture/jellyfin-plugin-one-prerelease, and what this page says about it is read from the roster rather than written here.</p>
